\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">기술을 발전 및 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">Water </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">플랜트에 접목하여 효율성 제고 방안을 제안하시오</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;(2) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">두산중공업의 미래를 위한 유망 신기술 혹은 신재생 에너지 기술을 제안하시오</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2) &nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">마케팅 주제</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;(1) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">두산중공업의 보유한 기술을 활용하여 국내외 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">CSR </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">차원에서 적용 가능한 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">새로운 아이디어를 제안하시오</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;(2) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">전기 부족국가를 선정하고 전력난 해소를 위한 두산중공업 진출 전략을 제안하시오</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4.&n